<title>RUSSIA: Rouble lower at 5,442 per dlr in Moscow.</title>
<headline>Rouble lower at 5,442 per dlr in Moscow.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The rouble edged down to 5,442 to the dollar on the Moscow Interbank Currency Exchange (MICEX) from 5,441 on Thursday.</p>
<p>					Oct 25		  Oct 24</p>
<p> Dollar rate			 5,442		   5,441</p>
<p> Volume traded (million $)	8.84		    3.11</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
